# Boot flags decide about the desktop for one boot: `desktop=off` here.
# (`desktop` or `desktop=on` force it on; see desktop-saved.scn.)
@args desktop=off mode=1280x720
$ desktop
desktop: off ('desktop on' starts it)
@screenshot 1280x720 text
$ desktop on
desktop on (RAM disk: not kept after reboot)
$ desktop
desktop: on, the terminal window has 147x37 characters ('desktop off' ends it)
@screenshot 1280x720 pixels 0,0=a8d0f0 1279,719=a8d0f0 640,52=3a6ea5
